        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Haze of Lucidity</i>, commonly shortened to <strong>Halu</strong>, is a psychological horror game that follows Ryan, a young man living alone in his apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As strange disturbances begin to take over his everyday life, Ryan finds himself questioning everything around him. Are these events really happening, or are they only illusions created by his own mind? The line between reality and hallucination slowly begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the apartment. Survive the disturbances. Uncover the nightmare Ryan has been trapped in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.poster.avif?t=1787728871\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.webm?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.mp4?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story hidden beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Immersive First-Person Perspective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing feels quite real. But nothing is completely fake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 <strong>Haunted Mundanity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the ordinary. Notice the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every silence is worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Piece Together the Truth</strong><br>Clues are scattered in the environment, the dialogue, the flicker of a screen. Do you really want to remember?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains themes of mental distress, trauma, and psychological manipulation.<br>Play with headphones. And maybe… don’t play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.poster.avif?t=1787728871\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.webm?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.mp4?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Haze of Lucidity</i>, commonly shortened to <strong>Halu</strong>, is a psychological horror game that follows Ryan, a young man living alone in his apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As strange disturbances begin to take over his everyday life, Ryan finds himself questioning everything around him. Are these events really happening, or are they only illusions created by his own mind? The line between reality and hallucination slowly begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the apartment. Survive the disturbances. Uncover the nightmare Ryan has been trapped in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.poster.avif?t=1787728871\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.webm?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.mp4?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story hidden beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Immersive First-Person Perspective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing feels quite real. But nothing is completely fake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 <strong>Haunted Mundanity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the ordinary. Notice the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every silence is worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Piece Together the Truth</strong><br>Clues are scattered in the environment, the dialogue, the flicker of a screen. Do you really want to remember?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains themes of mental distress, trauma, and psychological manipulation.<br>Play with headphones. And maybe… don’t play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.poster.avif?t=1787728871\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.webm?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.mp4?t=1787728871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
